# Fenwick update benchmark with no input parsing.
# 500000 updates start at p = 1, so each update takes the long path.
# Expected output: 500000

Sonome kas N tas 500000.
Sonome kas Q tas 500000.
Sonome kas bit tas Kisite kas fill vis 0 kasta N + 1.
Sonome kas qi tas 0.
Sonome kas p tas 0.

Pilike palusta qi < Q {
    Kemese kas p tas 1.
    Pilike palusta p <= N {
        bit[p] += 1.
        p += p & -p.
    }
    qi += 1.
}

Takute kas bit[262144].
